{"version":1,"content":"<p>效力於西甲球會皇家馬德里的法國球星麥巴比「辱毛風波」未了，央視停播西甲本輪所有比賽；</p><p>西甲在內地的独家網絡直播商、中移動旗下「咪咕視頻」則如常直播除皇馬以外其他比賽。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:47.239932+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T12:49:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:44.902110+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.770879+00:00","content_hash":"2a9a7ed024010ce498adf07c7b7fe9e077ce4fe521cb3411f8a3a7973f9b1f91","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}